o is now a researcher at NASA."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1993, "end": 2114, "text": "\"He instilled in us a sense of curiosity and a passion for discovery that will stay with us for the rest of our careers.\""}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2115, "end": 2270, "text": "Groves' passing leaves a void in the academic community, but his work and legacy will continue to inspire and influence generations of researchers to come."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c1", "entity": "Donald Groves", "scope": "organization", "claim": "Donald Groves worked for the Renaissance School of Medicine at Stony Brook University.", "answer": "Renaissance School of Medicine at Stony Brook University", "quote": "Kenneth Kaushansky, Dean of the Renaissance School of Medicine at Stony Brook University, praised Groves' contributions, saying, \"Donald's work has been instrumental in shaping the future of healthcare.", "original_document_number": 1}], "current_answers": ["Stony Brook University Hospital", "University of Washington", "Renaissance School of Medicine at Stony Brook University"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Stony Brook University Hospital", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "University of Washington", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "Renaissance School of Medicine at Stony Brook University", "origin": "coverage_addition"}]}
